    narr:narration """The implementation of a [signed release manifest requirement](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for Meridian deployments marks a shift toward stricter governance, explicitly triggered by [past failures in artifact integrity](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2). As of August 2026, this [gate is formally established](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) and [defined in scope](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) to cover both staging and production environments. The initiative is centralized under [Quinton Fairweather](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5), who frames the mandate as a necessary conservation measure to ensure deployment security. While the current documentation establishes the rule as a firm requirement, the narrative remains focused on the immediate enforcement of the gate rather than potential exceptions or operational friction that might arise during implementation.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
